[{"id":"r-A2-01","title":"Grandma Learns Video Calls","title_zh":"奶奶学会了视频通话","title_ja":"おばあちゃんのビデオ通話","cat":"life","p":[[["My grandmother lives alone in a small town, about three hours from our city.","我奶奶一个人住在一个小镇上，离我们的城市大约三个小时。","祖母は、私たちの町から三時間ほど離れた小さな町で一人で暮らしています。"],["Last spring, my father gave her a tablet as a birthday present.","去年春天，爸爸送了她一台平板电脑作为生日礼物。","去年の春、父が誕生日プレゼントとして祖母にタブレットをあげました。"],["At first, she was nervous and didn't want to touch it because she was worried about breaking it.","一开始她很紧张，不想碰它，因为她担心把它弄坏。","最初、祖母は緊張していて、壊してしまうのが心配で、さわろうともしませんでした。"]],[["So every weekend, I called her and slowly explained one small thing at a time.","所以每个周末我都给她打电话，慢慢地一次讲一件小事。","そこで私は毎週末に電話をして、一回に一つずつ小さなことをゆっくり説明しました。"],["First she learned to turn it on, and then she learned to answer a video call with one simple touch.","她先学会了开机，然后学会了轻轻一点就接通视频电话。","まず電源の入れ方を覚え、次に軽くさわるだけでビデオ通話に出る方法を覚えました。"],["For a few weeks, I could only see her ear or the ceiling on my screen, and we both laughed a lot.","有几个星期，我在屏幕上只能看到她的耳朵或者天花板，我们俩都笑了很多次。","数週間は、画面に祖母の耳か天井しか映らず、二人でたくさん笑いました。"],["Luckily, she was patient and didn't give up.","幸运的是，她很有耐心，没有放弃。","幸い、祖母はしんぼう強く、あきらめませんでした。"],["Now she calls me nearly every evening and happily shows me her garden.","现在她几乎每天晚上都给我打电话，开心地给我看她的花园。","今では祖母はほぼ毎晩電話をくれて、うれしそうに庭を見せてくれます。"],["Last week she even sent me a photograph of her cat wearing a very small hat.","上周她甚至发给我一张照片，是她的猫戴着一顶小小的帽子。","先週は、とても小さな帽子をかぶった猫の写真まで送ってくれました。"],["She says the tablet makes the three hours feel much shorter, and she isn't nervous about it anymore.","她说有了平板电脑，那三个小时的距离感觉短多了，而且她再也不紧张了。","タブレットのおかげで三時間の距離がずっと近く感じられるし、もう緊張することもないと祖母は言います。"]]],"w":[["nervous","紧张的","緊張した；不安な"],["worried","担心的","心配した"],["explain","解释；说明","説明する"],["screen","屏幕","画面"],["luckily","幸运地","幸い"],["nearly","几乎","ほとんど"],["anymore","再也（不）","もう（〜ない）"],["ceiling","天花板","天井"]],"q":[["Why didn't Grandma want to touch the tablet at first?","She was worried about breaking it.","She thought it was too expensive.","She didn't like her son's gift.","She already had a better one."],["What did the writer see on the screen for a few weeks?","Grandma's ear or the ceiling","Grandma's garden","Only a black screen","Grandma's cat"],["What does Grandma do nearly every evening now?","She calls the writer.","She goes to a computer class.","She visits the city.","She buys new hats for her cat."]]},{"id":"r-A2-02","title":"Too Much Salt","title_zh":"盐放多了","title_ja":"塩を入れすぎた","cat":"food","p":[[["On Saturday, Ken decided to make vegetable soup for his friends.","星期六，健决定给朋友们做蔬菜汤。","土曜日、ケンは友だちのために野菜スープを作ることにしました。"],["He followed a recipe from the internet, but he read it too quickly.","他照着网上的一份食谱做，但是读得太快了。","インターネットのレシピどおりに作りましたが、読むのが速すぎました。"],["The recipe said one teaspoon of salt, but he put in one tablespoon instead, and that is a much bigger spoon.","食谱上写的是一茶匙盐，可他却放了一汤匙，那可是大得多的勺子。","レシピには小さじ一杯の塩と書いてありましたが、ケンは代わりに大さじ一杯を入れてしまいました。大さじはずっと大きなスプーンです。"],["When he tasted the soup, his face turned red.","他尝了一口汤，脸都红了。","スープの味見をすると、ケンの顔は真っ赤になりました。"]],[["His friends were arriving in thirty minutes, so he was worried and called his mother for help.","朋友们三十分钟后就要到了，所以他很着急，打电话向妈妈求助。","友だちは三十分後に来ることになっていたので、ケンは心配になって母親に電話で助けを求めました。"],["She told him to add more water and a few pieces of potato.","妈妈让他多加些水，再放几块土豆。","母親は、水をもっと足して、じゃがいもを何切れか入れるように言いました。"],["The potatoes take in some of the salt while they cook.","土豆在煮的时候会吸收一部分盐。","じゃがいもは煮ている間に塩の一部を吸ってくれます。"],["In the end, the soup still had a little too much salt, but it was still good.","最后，汤还是有点咸，但依然很好喝。","結局、スープは少し塩が多すぎましたが、それでもおいしかったです。"],["Now Ken always reads a recipe twice before he starts, so he doesn't make the same mistake again.","现在健开始做菜前总会把食谱读两遍，这样就不会再犯同样的错误了。","今ではケンは作り始める前にいつもレシピを二回読むので、同じ間違いはしなくなりました。"]]],"w":[["decide","决定","決める"],["recipe","食谱","レシピ"],["follow","按照；遵循","（〜に）従う"],["instead","代替；反而","代わりに"],["salt","盐","塩"],["worried","担心的","心配した"],["twice","两次","二回"],["mistake","错误","間違い"]],"q":[["What mistake did Ken make?","He put in one tablespoon of salt instead of one teaspoon.","He forgot to put in any salt.","He used too much water.","He forgot to cook the potatoes."],["Who helped Ken fix the soup?","His mother","His friends","A chef on the internet","His neighbor"],["Why did his mother tell him to add potatoes?","They take in some of the salt.","They make the soup sweeter.","His friends love potatoes.","The recipe needed more vegetables."]],"ph":["photos/r-A2-02.jpg","Gannu03","CC BY-SA 4.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vegetable_soup_9.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A2-03","title":"The School Garden","title_zh":"学校的菜园","title_ja":"学校の菜園","cat":"school","p":[[["Behind our school, there was an empty piece of land full of rocks and old grass.","我们学校后面有一块空地，满是石头和枯草。","私たちの学校の裏には、石や枯れた草だらけの空き地がありました。"],["Last year, our science teacher, Ms. Ortiz, had an idea.","去年，我们的科学老师奥尔蒂斯老师想到了一个主意。","去年、理科のオルティス先生があるアイデアを思いつきました。"],["She asked each class to take care of one small part of the land.","她让每个班负责照顾这块地的一小部分。","先生は、各クラスに土地の小さな一区画ずつを担当するように頼みました。"]],[["My class planted tomatoes, beans, and some sunflowers.","我们班种了西红柿、豆子和一些向日葵。","私のクラスはトマトと豆と、ひまわりを何本か植えました。"],["We had to water them every morning before class, even on cold days.","我们每天上课前都得给它们浇水，连冷天也不例外。","寒い日でも、毎朝授業の前に水をやらなければなりませんでした。"],["Some students complained at first, but soon everyone wanted to check the plants.","起初有些同学抱怨，但很快大家都想去看看那些植物。","最初は文句を言う生徒もいましたが、すぐにみんなが植物の様子を見たがるようになりました。"],["In September, the sunflowers were taller than our teacher.","到了九月，向日葵长得比我们老师还高。","九月には、ひまわりは先生より背が高くなっていました。"],["We picked the tomatoes and made a big salad for the whole school.","我们摘了西红柿，给全校做了一大份沙拉。","私たちはトマトを収穫して、学校のみんなのために大きなサラダを作りました。"],["Now the garden is the most popular place at lunchtime.","现在菜园是午饭时间最受欢迎的地方。","今では、昼休みにいちばん人気のある場所はこの菜園です。"]]],"w":[["empty","空的","空いている；からの"],["land","土地","土地"],["take care of","照顾","世話をする"],["plant","种植；植物","植える；植物"],["bean","豆子","豆"],["sunflower","向日葵","ひまわり"],["complain","抱怨","文句を言う"],["pick","摘；采","摘む；収穫する"],["popular","受欢迎的","人気のある"]],"q":[["What was behind the school before the garden?","An empty piece of land with rocks","A parking lot","A small park with trees","A sports field"],["When did the students water the plants?","Every morning before class","Only on weekends","After school on Fridays","Only when it was hot"],["What did the students make with the tomatoes?","A big salad for the whole school","Tomato soup for their teacher","Sauce to sell at a market","Juice for a sports day"]],"ph":["photos/r-A2-03.jpg","Alabama Extension","CC0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tomatoes_in_a_raised_bed_garden_-_49746265226.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A2-04","title":"A Night on the Train","title_zh":"火车上的一夜","title_ja":"夜行列車の一夜","cat":"travel","p":[[["Last summer, Mia and her brother took a night train for the first time.","去年夏天，米娅和弟弟第一次坐了夜车。","去年の夏、ミアと弟は初めて夜行列車に乗りました。"],["Their room on the train was very small, with two beds, one above the other.","他们在火车上的房间很小，有两张床，一张在另一张上面。","列車の部屋はとても小さく、ベッドが二つ上下に並んでいました。"],["Her brother wanted the top bed, so Mia took the bottom one.","弟弟想睡上铺，所以米娅睡了下铺。","弟が上のベッドをほしがったので、ミアは下のベッドにしました。"]],[["Before bed, they ate sandwiches and watched the lights of small towns pass by the window.","睡觉前，他们吃了三明治，看着小镇的灯光从窗外闪过。","寝る前に二人はサンドイッチを食べ、小さな町の明かりが窓の外を通り過ぎていくのをながめました。"],["The train moved softly from side to side, like a slow boat on a lake.","火车轻轻地左右摇晃，就像湖上一条慢慢行驶的小船。","列車は湖の上をゆっくり進むボートのように、やさしく左右に揺れました。"],["Mia thought she couldn't sleep, but she fell asleep in a few minutes.","米娅以为自己会睡不着，可是没过几分钟就睡着了。","ミアは眠れないだろうと思っていましたが、数分で眠ってしまいました。"],["When she opened her eyes, the sun was shining on the mountains outside the window.","她睁开眼睛时，阳光正照在窗外的山上。","目を開けると、窓の外の山に太陽の光が当たっていました。"],["They were in a different country, and they didn't even feel the long journey.","他们已经到了另一个国家，却丝毫没有感觉到这段漫长的旅程。","二人はもう別の国にいて、長い旅をしたことさえ感じませんでした。"],["Mia says it was the most comfortable hotel room she has ever had.","米娅说，那是她住过的最舒服的“酒店房间”。","ミアは、今までで一番快適なホテルの部屋だったと言います。"]]],"w":[["above","在……上面","〜の上に"],["bottom","底部；下面","下；底"],["side","侧，边","側"],["pass","经过","通り過ぎる"],["asleep","睡着的","眠って"],["shine","照耀","輝く；照らす"],["journey","旅程","旅"],["comfortable","舒适的","快適な"]],"q":[["Which bed did Mia sleep in?","The bottom bed","The top bed","A bed in another room","She didn't sleep."],["What did they do before bed?","They ate sandwiches and looked out the window.","They went to the dining car for dinner.","They played cards with other travelers.","They called their parents."],["What did Mia see when she opened her eyes?","The sun on the mountains","The lights of small towns","Her brother eating breakfast","A big city station"]],"ph":["photos/r-A2-04.jpg","Alfie Pates","CC BY-SA 4.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Caledonian_Sleeper_Seated_Compartment.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A2-05","title":"Why Leaves Change Color","title_zh":"树叶为什么会变色","title_ja":"葉っぱはなぜ色が変わるの？","cat":"nature","p":[[["In fall, many trees change from green to yellow, orange, or red.","秋天，许多树会从绿色变成黄色、橙色或红色。","秋になると、多くの木が緑から黄色やオレンジ色、赤に変わります。"],["But where do these bright colors come from?","可是这些鲜艳的颜色是从哪里来的呢？","でも、このあざやかな色はどこから来るのでしょうか。"],["In spring and summer, leaves are full of a green material that helps them make food from sunlight.","春天和夏天，叶子里充满了一种绿色的物质，它帮助叶子利用阳光制造养分。","春と夏の葉には緑色の物質がたくさんあり、それが日光から栄養を作るのを助けています。"],["This green color is so strong that we can't see the other colors in the leaf.","这种绿色太浓了，我们看不到叶子里的其他颜色。","この緑色がとても強いので、葉の中のほかの色は見えません。"]],[["When the days get shorter and colder, the tree stops producing the green material.","当白天变短、天气变冷时，树就不再产生这种绿色物质。","日が短くなって寒くなると、木はその緑色の物質を作るのをやめます。"],["Slowly the green disappears, and the yellow and orange colors can finally appear.","绿色慢慢消失，黄色和橙色终于显现出来。","緑色はだんだん消えていき、黄色やオレンジ色がやっと現れます。"],["Some trees, like many maples, also produce new red colors in the fall.","有些树，比如很多枫树，在秋天还会产生新的红色。","多くのカエデのように、秋に新しく赤い色を作る木もあります。"],["So the yellow was actually there during the whole summer, hiding under the green.","所以，黄色其实整个夏天都在那里，只是藏在绿色下面。","つまり黄色は、実は夏の間ずっとそこにあって、緑色の下にかくれていたのです。"]]],"w":[["bright","鲜艳的；明亮的","あざやかな；明るい"],["material","物质；材料","物質；材料"],["sunlight","阳光","日光"],["strong","强烈的","強い"],["produce","产生；制造","作り出す"],["disappear","消失","消える"],["appear","出现","現れる"],["actually","实际上","実は"]],"q":[["What does the green material in leaves help them do?","Make food from sunlight","Stay warm in winter","Fall off the tree","Get water from the rain"],["What happens when the days get shorter and colder?","The tree stops producing the green material.","The leaves become greener.","The tree produces more yellow material.","The leaves get bigger."],["According to the text, where was the yellow color in summer?","Under the green color","In the roots of the tree","In the flowers","It didn't exist yet."]],"ph":["photos/r-A2-05.jpg","ForestWander","CC BY-SA 3.0 us","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Autumn-red-maple-leaves-lake-reflection_-_West_Virginia_-_ForestWander.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A2-06","title":"Lightning and Thunder","title_zh":"闪电和雷声","title_ja":"稲妻と雷の音","cat":"science","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A2-06.jpg","Maxime Raynal from France","CC BY 2.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Port_and_lighthouse_overnight_storm_with_lightning_in_Port-la-Nouvelle.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A2-07","title":"Rain, Snow, and Letters","title_zh":"风雨无阻的邮递员","title_ja":"雨の日も雪の日も","cat":"work","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A2-07.jpg","Leonid LogvynenkoIf you have any questions please contact with me. Other photos see here.Якщо у Вас є якісь запитання бу","CC BY-SA 4.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mail_carrier_Valentyna_in_Mysailivka.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A2-08","title":"The Birthday Piñata","title_zh":"生日皮纳塔","title_ja":"誕生日のピニャータ","cat":"culture","lock":1},{"id":"r-A2-09","title":"A Walk After Dinner","title_zh":"饭后散步","title_ja":"夕食後の散歩","cat":"health","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A2-09.jpg","PattayaPatrol","CC BY-SA 4.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:DSC_8420_Evening_stroll_along_a_palmlined_beachfront_promenade_with_people_walking_street_vendors_and_